    "lawCode": "Amd §2502, Ed L",
    "lawSection": "Education Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S7432\n\nSPONSOR: BRESLIN\n \nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the education law, in relation to the\nelections of members to the board of education of the city school\ndistrict of the city of Albany\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo amend the sections of the education law to be consistent technically\nconsistent with Chapter 84 of the laws of 2017.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: amends paragraphs c,h,k,m, n, o and p of subdivision 92 of\nsection 2502 of the education law, paragraphs c and h as added by chap-\nter 65 of the laws of 1972, paragraph k as amended by chapter 221 of the\nlaws of 1995, and paragraphs m,n,o and p as amended by chapter 84 of the\nlaws of 2017.\n\nSection 2: Effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation is needed to make various sections of the education law\nconsistent with the changes that necessitated by the adoption of Chapter\n84 of the laws of 2017.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
