    "lawCode": "Rpld §2502 sub 9, amd §§2601 & 2601-a, Ed L",
    "lawSection": "Education Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S7432A\n\nSPONSOR: BRESLIN\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the education law, in relation to the elections of\nmembers to the board of education of the city school district of the\ncity of Albany; and to repeal subdivision 9 of section 2502 of the\neducation law relating thereto\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo amend the sections of the education law to be consistent technically\nconsistent with Chapter 84 of the laws of 2017.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: Repeals subdivision 9 of section 2502 of the education law.\n\nSection 2: Amends section 2601 of the education law as amended by chap-\nter 171 as amended by the laws of 1996.\n\nSection 3: Amends subdivision 2 of section 2601-a of the education law,\nas amended by section 9 of part A of chapter 97 of the laws of 2011.\n\nSection 4: Amends Subdivision 2 of section 2601-a of the education law\nas amended by section 6 of Part M of chapter 57 of the laws of 2005.\n\nSection 5: effective date\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation is needed to make various sections of the education law\nconsistent with the changes that necessitated by the adoption of Chapter\n84 of the laws of 2017.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
